		{
			title: "修补完成"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "octagon"
			subtitle: "射击，包扎，掠夺。战争的舞步。"
			description: [
				"被刀剑类武器和某些敌人击中时，你可能会流血。"
				""
				"流血是一种缓慢但严重的持续性伤害，通常用&a绷带&r就能解除，无论是给自己还是给友方使用绷带的对象。"
				""
				"However as your vitality expands sometimes the light healing of the bandage isn't enough to keep you going. The &agolden bandage&r, although a considerable step up in EMC cost, provides the recipient with a stronger regeneration and bleed immunity for a period of time afterwards."
				""
				"&4注意，并非所有起源都能使用绷带或受益于再生&r。但通常这也意味着无法流血。这类起源需要使用其他治疗方式，或寻找安全地点，通过保持饥饿度高于半血来自然恢复。"
				""
				"If you have accessed &6The Atum&r for linen and have access to potions, &alinen bandages&r made with linen treated with potions of healing can create slightly cheaper bandages &awhich can heal a considerable amount of HP and purge you of status effects&r after a relatively lengthy application time. Of course, in these cases, sometimes just chugging a well made potion and some milk might be faster. It's up to you."
			]
			min_width: 500
			id: "306DBA4C75EA282C"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "77E26F6BCC4466E7"
					type: "item"
					title: "简易绷带。快速再生，清除流血。"
					item: "majruszs_difficulty:bandage"
				}
				{
					id: "0E4083080DEC6F3D"
					type: "item"
					title: "金绷带。再生更长更强，清除流血，并有状态效果防止流血。"
					item: "majruszs_difficulty:golden_bandage"
				}
				{
					id: "169FEB3B6971A12F"
					type: "item"
					title: "亚麻绷带。比金绷带便宜，但需要时间敷用。可移除所有状态效果并立即治愈。"
					item: "atum:linen_bandage"
				}
			]
