		{
			title: "末影邮政服务"
			icon: "endermail:stamp"
			x: -1.0d
			y: -1.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "末地资源掉落事件"
			description: [
				"Communication between wandering groups and sharing of resources is a commonly needed practice. But sometimes personally creating warp scrolls and moving to shared locations to share items or plan movements can be a lot of EMC. &oThankfully our people have since been in contact with a number of helpful groups of endermen, befriended by enderians throughout their travels.&r"
				""
				"自那时起，教团便雇佣了这些能快速移动的末影人作为信使。要使用&6末影邮件服务&r非常简单。&a你只需要纸、末影珍珠、铁、史莱姆（或类似的粘合剂）和一个箱子。&r"
				""
				"首先，用末影珍珠的签名标记纸张，制作一个&6末影信邮票&r。然后用纸张和粘合剂制作&6卷包装胶带&r，将箱子转换为&6包裹&r。最后，用其中一个邮票制作一个简单的定位装置，以获得&6包裹控制器&r。"
				""
				"&aTo then send items place the package down and put items in it&r. When the package is filled &ause a stamp on it&r and enter the desired &aexact co-ordinates &lwithin your same dimension&r to send the items to and &aconfirm it&r &3&o(confirm button at the far bottom right)&r. Finally a simple &ashift right click with a ready package controller will summon an ender mailman to collect the package and send it to the desired location&r. The package should arrive not even a minute later. Now that's service!"
				""
				"This service can &aquickly deliver items such as the warp plate shards and bound scrolls&r to contractor groups, facilitating fast transportation. Or you can &amail entire backpacks, resources for learning or specialist tools to those immediately in need&r to complete objectives. It doesn't need to be about work, a &afriendly package containing some delicious new food or a curious item that someone would appreciate using&r is a wonderful gesture also."
			]
			min_width: 500
			id: "6331928DC7E2C7AB"
